    "The connection to the device was lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与设备的连接已断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device accepted the password, but saving it to the keychain failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备已接受密码，但保存到钥匙串失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device did not confirm the password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备没有确认这次密码设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device is not connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device rejected the password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备拒绝了该密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device stores the password and types it after a fingerprint match. Saving also updates every enrolled fingerprint.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码保存在设备中，指纹匹配后由设备键入。保存时会同步更新所有已录入指纹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device types the password only while TouchUnlock is running. Quit the app and touching the sensor does nothing, so keep the app running and turn on Open at Login in Settings. Fingerprint unlock at the lock screen keeps working as long as the app is running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有触达运行时，设备才会键入密码。退出应用后触碰传感器不会有任何反应，所以请让应用保持运行，并在“设置”里打开“登录时打开”。只要应用在运行，锁屏界面的指纹解锁照常可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device types the password only while this app is running. When the app is not running, touching the sensor does nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有本应用运行时，设备才会键入密码。应用没有运行时，触碰传感器不会有任何反应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fingerprint was enrolled, but binding the password failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指纹已录入，但关联密码失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The light starts blinking quickly, which means it is in pairing mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指示灯开始快速闪烁，即表示已进入配对模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log never contains passwords.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日志不包含密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is kept on this Mac only. The device stores fingerprints by number, so a name never travels with the reader.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名字只保存在这台 Mac 上。设备按编号存指纹，名字不会跟着识别器走。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password copy stays in the keychain of this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码副本只保存在本机钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password is incorrect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
