            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 无法使用低功耗蓝牙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This finger is already enrolled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这根手指已经录入过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This finger is not enrolled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这根手指没有录入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch an enrolled finger to unlock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触碰已录入的手指即可解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch the sensor with this finger to unlock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用这根手指触碰传感器即可解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TouchUnlock reads whether the frontmost window is asking for a password, so the reader types only when there is somewhere to type. Without this permission it can still notice secure password prompts, but not every password field. You will find the switch in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Device Control and Data Access.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触达会读取前台窗口是否在等密码，只有在有地方可以输入时识别器才会键入。没有这个权限时，它仍能识别安全密码输入提示，但覆盖不到所有密码框。开关在「系统设置 → 隐私与安全 → 设备控制和数据访问」里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
