        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用系统密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used to link new fingerprints automatically and to confirm deleting one. It never leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于给新指纹自动关联密码，以及删除指纹前的确认。它不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the system password": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a window is asking for a password, this fingerprint types the password set here. At the lock screen the system password is always used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有窗口在等密码时，这根指纹会输入这里设置的密码。锁屏时一律使用系统密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the Dock icon is hidden, the app stays in the menu bar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏程序坞图标后，应用只留在菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has no keyboard for the device. Forget it in Bluetooth settings and pair it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 没有为设备创建键盘。请在蓝牙设置中忘记它，然后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS recognizes the device as a keyboard.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
